+
+<!-- task body. `wingfoil memory add` copies this scaffold verbatim; `memory submit` replaces
+     these placeholder comments with real content and fills the required frontmatter fields. -->
+
+## Report 1 — welcome code refused after cancelling (fixed)
+`OrderService.cancel` gave the coupon back with the customer id instead of the order id, so
+`Coupons.giveBack` never matched the recorded order and the single-use coupon stayed used. Now it
+passes the order id. Test added in `test/coupons.test.ts` (red first, then green).
+
+## Report 2 — €4.90 shipping on €50.00 of goods (no code change)
+Shipping is free when goods are €50.00 or more *after every discount* (README). The code does this
+and `test/reports-fixes.test.ts` already covers exactly €50.00. An order whose goods were €50.00
+before a volume discount or coupon legitimately pays shipping. Needs the order number from support
+to confirm; if its goods after discounts were below €50.00, behaviour is as specified.
